# Internal engineering and business documentation lives in a private repository
# (inktavia-docs). Only the curated numbered sections are published here.
/docs/*
!/docs/00-overview/
!/docs/01-git-governance/
!/docs/02-microservices/
!/docs/03-performance/
!/docs/04-database/
!/docs/05-messaging/
!/docs/06-nosql-redis/
!/docs/07-security/
!/docs/08-load-test/

# --- shell scripts -----------------------------------------------------------
# Line 10's blanket `*.sh` treats every shell script as build output. Project
# scripts are SOURCE, so they are re-included here. `git add` reports NO ERROR
# for an ignored path, so a dropped script is invisible until CI fails with
# exit 127 ("bash: <file>: No such file or directory").
#
# 🔴 2026-08-22 DERSI — bu blok UC KEZ kopyalanmisti ve ucu de AYNI hatayi
# tasiyordu: `!**/build/*.sh` yalnizca `build/` ALTINDAKI DOGRUDAN dosyalari
# geri alir, `build/ci/*.sh`'i ALMAZ. Sonuc: Faz 20'nin
# `build/ci/gitops-frontend-isaretci-denetimi.sh` betigi depoya HIC girmedi ve
# "Frontend surum isaretci denetimi" is akisi ilk kosusunda exit 127 verdi.
# Ayni exit 127 daha once de yasanmis, her seferinde bu blogun bir KOPYASI daha
# eklenmis ama DESEN hic duzeltilmemis — kopyalamak dogrulamanin yerine gecmez.
# Dogrusu asagidaki `**` ile HER DERINLIK: build/x.sh, build/ci/x.sh, daha alti.
# `git check-ignore` ile dogrulandi (2026-08-22).
!scripts/**/*.sh
!infrastructure/**/*.sh
!**/build/**/*.sh

# Dev-seed fixtures are generated by scripts/dev-seed/gen_assets.py.
# This rule lived in .git/info/exclude, which is per-clone and never shared.
scripts/dev-seed/assets/

# Ic dokumantasyon AYRI depoda (inktavia-docs). Bu PUBLIC depoya kazara
# kopyalanmasin: 2026-08-21'de bir arac tam olarak bunu yapti ve dosyalar
# yalniz elle fark edildigi icin disari sizmedi.
/inktavia-docs/
